TI  - Influence of precipitation and species composition on phytomass of a semi‐arid African grassland
AU  - T.G. O’Connor
AU  - Linda M. Haines
AU  - H.A. Snyman
JO  - Journal of Ecology
PY  - 2001
VL  - 89
IS  - 5
SP  - 850
