TI  - Pyric Herbivory: Rewilding Landscapes through the Recoupling of Fire and Grazing
AU  - Samuel D. Fuhlendorf
AU  - David M. Engle
AU  - Jay D. Kerby
AU  - Robert G. Hamilton
JO  - Conservation Biology
PY  - 2008
VL  - 23
IS  - 3
